[Unit]
Description=Alarm WhatsApp bila backup Drive Tech gagal total
[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment=HOME=/root
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/drivetech-alert.sh "⚠️ Backup Drive Tech GAGAL dijalankan (unit systemd error, bukan sekadar NAS mati). Cek: journalctl -u drivetech-backup-nas.service dan /var/log/drivetech-backup.log"
